WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.149
Open Tools and find WhatsApp Business under Add more tools

00:00:05.149 --> 00:00:07.112
Click Setup WhatsApp Business Account

00:00:07.112 --> 00:00:10.762
Meta's sign-in window opens here (not shown)

00:00:10.762 --> 00:00:12.570
Connected: the account page lists your numbers

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:14.986
Click Register on the pending number

00:00:14.986 --> 00:00:19.697
Set an optional 6-digit PIN, then click Register

00:00:19.697 --> 00:00:21.100
The number is Ready: it can send and receive

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:23.721
Open Message templates

00:00:23.721 --> 00:00:25.130
Each template shows its category, language and status

00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:27.750
Click New template

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:32.403
Name it and write the body with variables

00:00:32.403 --> 00:00:37.754
Give Meta a sample value for every variable

00:00:37.754 --> 00:00:43.423
Add a footer and a quick reply button

00:00:43.423 --> 00:00:45.289
The preview shows the message as a WhatsApp bubble

00:00:45.289 --> 00:00:48.892
Click Submit for review

00:00:48.892 --> 00:00:50.495
It shows In review until Meta approves it

00:00:50.495 --> 00:00:54.558
Send a test from a Ready template's menu

00:00:54.558 --> 00:01:04.577
Enter the recipient and fill every variable

00:01:04.577 --> 00:01:07.879
Click Send test

00:01:07.879 --> 00:01:13.887
Add number offers a Ringg number or your own
